fort and concentration involved in operating a X. Physicians warned that the expression could become permanent. They also worried that the X would damage women's reproductive organs, encourage immodesty, and provide unsupervised opportunities to meet men. In 1896, asked by a journalist what she thought of X, Susan B. Anthony famously answered, \"I'll tell you what I think of it. I think it has done more to emancipate women than anything else in the world. It gives a woman a feeling of freedom and self-reliance.\" ID X (5 points) and Y (5 points). ‎<attached: 00123307-PHOTO-2026-04-21-20-48-04.jpg>", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:48:36Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Bicycle?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:48:36Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Sewing is x?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:48:37Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "X", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:49:09Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "The condition was called “bicycle Y”", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:49:09Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Bicycle Face?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:49:27Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Thanks saumay lol", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}]